# This repository is written on Windows and runs on Linux. Without this, a
# Windows checkout rewrites the shell scripts to CRLF and `airgap.sh pack`
# copies them into the transfer set with a carriage return on the shebang
# line — which the target reports as
#
#     bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M: No such file or directory
#
# on a file that looks perfectly correct in an editor. Normalize to LF in the
# working tree regardless of platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts of a transfer set, should any ever be committed.
*.tar.gz binary
*.bundle binary
